 remember whether he said he forgot it or left it on the table -- I think he wanted to play the piano.  At least I got that feeling. But I mean he does play sort of nice arranger's piano but this is a different side of him and of course I love all of his tunes. I did woodshed a few of those tunes so that we could play them.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8467$CA805C7C-9A23-4810-B4C9-4D1AD90F9785", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "0c9cda7fa5a0f69bbf3ed43d517a34c68991cfdb", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/f42a04ad4c648debc2495a31b230dff1/19.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8467$D1AE3E7D-25E1-4632-B033-B2F773039FB8", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "f456c0bad10e533557bbbf1ac886d33a6d05649a", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 317, "id": "Q317"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8467$A6EBD03C-C2B4-4B8B-8EA8-7BD57C4C51A3", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "822817de2fcd98a6733398c7619f6c48a83e84ff", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 317, "id": "Q317"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8467$50CF0E69-1454-4945-95BF-FEAF63B32BED", "rank": "normal"}]}}